<title>USA: Matteson, Ill., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Matteson, Ill., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust said it won $5 million of Matteson, Ill., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.22 percent.</p>
